WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is the Healthcare Thermal Continuity war room. It protects the spaces a hospital cannot afford to lose. What follows is a simulated incident.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A chiller plant fault in the east tower is raising supply-air temperature in three zones, including the surgical suite. The operator loads the failure report.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Six engines read it. The surgical suite and pharmacy storage reach their temperature limits within three to six hours, and four scheduled procedures are affected. Exposure runs from three hundred fifty thousand to eight hundred thousand dollars. The risk score is seventy-seven out of one hundred.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
One click escalates the case to the Operations Strategist, which shows the exposure with action, and without it.

5
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The Executive Portal shows the decision: deploy temporary cooling to the surgical suite within two hours, for forty-five thousand dollars. The system recommends. The facilities director decides.

